# Model Summary

- Project: `[%= emitCtx.get("projectName") %]`
- Generator version: `[%= emitCtx.get("generatorVersion") %]`
- Production mode: `[%= emitCtx.get("productionMode") %]`
- Stages: `[%= awsRoot.stages.size() %]`
- Stacks: `[%= awsRoot.stacks.size() %]`
- Resources: `[%= awsRoot.allModeledResources().size() %]`

## Stages

[% for (stageObj in awsRoot.stages.sortBy(stageObj | stageObj.stageName)) { %]
- `[%= stageObj.stageName %]`: `[%= stageObj.environmentClass.asString() %]`, region `[%= stageObj.region.orElseText("not specified") %]`, manual approval `[%= stageObj.requiresManualApproval.orElseText("false") %]`
[% } %]

## Resources

[% for (resObj in awsRoot.allModeledResources()) { %]
- `[%= resObj.cfnLogicalId() %]`: `[%= resObj.eClass().getName() %]`, stable ID `[%= resObj.stableKey() %]`
[% } %]
